  "content": {
    "id": "v2-c5fa9-p19-practice-slot-7-lower-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": null,
    "prompt": "Priya scored 70 in a Geography exam in which the mean was 60 and the SD was 8.\n\nThe History exam has a mean of 52 and an SD of 6.\n\nWhat mark would she have to score in History for her performance to be equivalent?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$59.5$",
      "worked": "1. Calculate the z-score for Geography\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}z_G&=\\frac{x_G-\\mu_G}{\\sigma_G}\\\\z_G&=\\frac{70-60}{8}\\\\z_G&=1.25\\end{aligned}$$\n2. Calculate the equivalent score in History\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}x_H&=\\mu_H+z_G\\sigma_H\\\\x_H&=52+1.25(6)\\\\x_H&=59.5\\end{aligned}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": null
  },
